OL,3,AAt least 34 dead after Europe-bound
OL,4,Amigrant boat sinks off Senegal
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpanish migrant rights group Walking
OL,7,FBorders recorded 635 deaths on the
OL,8,FAtlantic route to the Canary Islands
OL,9,Fbetween January and May 2026, the
OL,10,Fhighest toll among the routes it
OL,11,Fmonitors.
